  message: "Now the recorded owner of INV-muhij's blocker (isbefore edge added 2026-09-03).\nINV-muhij's remedy needs an ordering test anchored on the EFFECT call of a\ndeferred constructor (exec.Command at gocryptfs daemonize.go:46 is the\ncatalogued sink; the crossing is c.Start() at :51), and c.Start() emits\ngo:external:0-0:Start because nothing declares what exec.Command returns.\nRe-measured on dev 68db7bd6e5: ln.Accept(), conn.Read(), c.Start(),\nc.StdoutPipe() all land on `external`; an in-repo factory's return type\nresolves (WI-doluf). A go-first slice -- os/exec, net, bufio, net/http\nproducers -- is the increment that moves INV-muhij and INV-kanuk's accept-loop\nfixture; the consumption path already exists."  # f504
